        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1300303",
      "subQuestName": "Meet Tighnari at Pardis Dhyai",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130030301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130030301": {
            "id": "130030301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Tighnari—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030302"
            ]
          },
          "130030302": {
            "id": "130030302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Shh, keep your voice down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030303"
            ]
          },
          "130030303": {
            "id": "130030303",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "The Lilac Daphne, a daphne of the genus Thymelaeaceae, has a strong anticonvulsant effect. It can also be made into an anesthetic powder...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030304"
            ]
          },
          "130030304": {
            "id": "130030304",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Extrapolating from these two data sets, it would be particularly potent against piscine species... Hey, make sure you're getting all this down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030305"
            ]
          },
          "130030305": {
            "id": "130030305",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kolu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030306"
            ]
          },
          "130030306": {
            "id": "130030306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Karkata!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030307"
            ]
          },
          "130030307": {
            "id": "130030307",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kalu! Kalu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030308"
            ]
          },
          "130030308": {
            "id": "130030308",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "I thought I told you all to keep your voices low. Plants aren't afraid of noise, but your shouting is making my ears ring.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030309"
            ]
          },
          "130030309": {
            "id": "130030309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y—You didn't disassemble Karkata?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030310"
            ]
          },
          "130030310": {
            "id": "130030310",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Why would I do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030311"
            ]
          },
          "130030311": {
            "id": "130030311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Paimon thought you said, \"According to the Akademiya's policies\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030312"
            ]
          },
          "130030312": {
            "id": "130030312",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "So that's why you two barged in like barbarians at this hour. Fine, I suppose I wasn't clear enough about this yesterday.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030313"
            ]
          },
          "130030313": {
            "id": "130030313",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "What I meant was, according to the Akademiya's policies, all products of research must be destroyed. That's why we can't let the Akademiya discover that place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030314"
            ]
          },
          "130030314": {
            "id": "130030314",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So the real reason you stayed back was to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030315"
            ]
          },
          "130030315": {
            "id": "130030315",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Anyway, the first thing I did was repair Karkata. During my time at the Akademiya, I took an elective course at the Spantamad. Who knew it would prove useful one day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030316"
            ]
          },
          "130030316": {
            "id": "130030316",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "We then buried Abattouy together. After organizing the research materials, I kept some as a souvenir, most of it was burned to hide the evidence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030317"
            ]
          },
          "130030317": {
            "id": "130030317",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "I'm not with the Akademiya, so what do their policies have to do with me? On the other hand, I am the Forest Watcher of the Avidya Forest. I have a duty to protect all life in the forest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030318"
            ]
          },
          "130030318": {
            "id": "130030318",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "All life brought forth in this world has meaning, and Karkata is no exception. If it exists, then it shouldn't be carelessly abandoned or destroyed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030319"
            ]
          },
          "130030319": {
            "id": "130030319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, that's great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030320"
            ]
          },
          "130030320": {
            "id": "130030320",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kulilu?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030321"
            ]
          },
          "130030321": {
            "id": "130030321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, you just said \"life form.\" You recognize Karkata as a true living being now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030322"
            ]
          },
          "130030322": {
            "id": "130030322",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "The possibility exists is all. It's hard to explain Karkata's efforts to \"repair\" Abattouy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030323"
            ]
          },
          "130030323": {
            "id": "130030323",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Abattouy only left behind a small portion of his research. Who knows how many commands he installed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030324"
            ]
          },
          "130030324": {
            "id": "130030324",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Maybe a conflict between all those commands resulted in this sort of behavior.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030325"
            ]
          },
          "130030325": {
            "id": "130030325",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "From a more rigorous perspective, it is impossible to conclude that Karkata is a real life form, but the possibility exists — I am willing to believe in that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030326"
            ]
          },
          "130030326": {
            "id": "130030326",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kolu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030327"
            ]
          },
          "130030327": {
            "id": "130030327",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "By the way, I'm not interested in continuing research on this subject. I'm just letting it hang out here because this place is relatively secluded.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030328"
            ]
          },
          "130030328": {
            "id": "130030328",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "But as things stand now, it wouldn't be a bad idea to make it my research assistant. At the very least, it can record my experiments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030329"
            ]
          },
          "130030329": {
            "id": "130030329",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "What do you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130030330"
            ]
          },
          "130030330": {
            "id": "130030330",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kalu! Kalu!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
